: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于\n            <span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.533333px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n             Finca San Luis\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 14px;'>\n          // 下述文字部分来源于咖篮公众号，以及部分翻译来源https://squaremileblog.com/2012/05/02/colombia-march-2012-finca-san-luis/\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.533333px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          由于地理位置，圣路易斯有一个特殊的条件，靠近厄瓜多尔边境线，它的海拔在1600到1900米之间。位于Nevado Del Ruiz附近的一个山谷中，这是哥伦比亚最重要和最重要的雪山之一，是天然水体的来源，也是大量动物种类的港湾。该农场拥有两种微气候:温带和雨林气候。咖啡种植与树木的遮荫系统相辅相成，为许多鸟类和其他野生动物创造了栖息地，支持了当地和国家野生动物的保护。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px 24px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.533333px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxOppxG1ibDnvc5bUl9V2iajVNFvhZWMVO6btNbfib1eibnosvDemMcr5daQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px 24px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园主Omar Arango一直负责Finca San Luis，在过去的近40年，他一直致力于改进精品咖啡的质量，学习更有效的种植、采收和处理方法。Arango反对使用化学农药，2015年便已取得有机认证。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px 24px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxg6CYIG8jEmdpicrytvibAgNgjyuEfkpoDJM8YJzJrbmXIDic9ibrl8zLcA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px 24px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在San Luis，产季时采摘工是按照天来计算日薪，而不是按照采摘的咖啡果重量；Omar说这种方式是为了避免采摘工在果子比较多时赚的多但是在果子少的时候就会收入很少，所以他决定按照日薪的方式支付，这样可以更稳定的留住采摘工人；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px 24px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          通常，工人们下午4-5天采摘回来，果子会脱皮后在水洗池里静置一天到第二日的下午5-6点清洗残留的果胶，由于已经晚上了，不方便再搬运去晒床晾晒，所以这些豆子就会用清水浸泡在池子里一晚，第二天早上再搬运去晾晒。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px 24px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在San Luis有两种晒床晾晒咖啡，高等级的咖啡会在一个三层的晒棚里，遮阴晾晒；其余的会在一个开放式的单层晒床进行晾晒。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px 8px 24px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxcYBqNLZcNUdOICE4x9Biaeeibqz3BbW1oFdeuC093kicHXXmgGFybNczQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZx0aVJaPc31GGfsGEgcXWn0fTlqqxpCbFTPsn4HBnOibVrz1rIdHrRzibw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;display: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;text-indent: 0em;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
